 "remarks": "Delightful, Open & Newer 2 BR/2-Bath in Desirable Palmer Square - Mere Steps and you're on the Path to the popular public Golf Course! This is a private, top floor - corner apartment loaded with windows & sunshine! Enjoy life in a meticulously maintained, conveniently located community with economic gas heat, central air + No ADDITIONAL FEES! This pretty home offers its own Private Entrance, bright open floor plan, extra windows, New Carpet being installed & entertainer's open kitchen with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances! You'll find 2 bedrooms, 2 baths and private Washer/Dryer. Come see this immaculately presented bright space, wonderfully situated within the complex - close to the golf course path! Beautifully maintained community features: On-Site Management, 24-Hour Security & Parking for 2-Cars. Pets are welcome with the following guidelines: 2 Dogs 35 Lbs., 1 Dog max 60 lbs., or 1-dog + 1-Cat or 2-Cats OK. $300 fully refundable pet deposit per pet required. Palmer Square is a No Smoking Community. Interested parties please complete a Palmer Square application uploaded in supplements, and supply a credit check through Applyconnect only. CARPETING BEING REPLACED.",
